  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1873110,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's today EUV."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1874750,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he published this\npaper, of course,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1878430,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he said he proposed to use\na reflecting mask instead"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1882210,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a transmission mask\nbecause reflecting mass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1884230,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The mask substrate\nis also multilayered."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1886510,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Any proposal to use\nlaser produced plasma."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1890610,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Both of these concepts\nare adopted nowadays."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1894930,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And of course, 1989 he\nand Nat saglio and others"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1901130,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually again they went\nto the three beams meeting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1904170,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they showed a mask that\nthey made multilayer mask"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1908690,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with gold absorber pattern."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1910830,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, we don't use gold,\nbut multilayers were used."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1914590,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here you go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1916350,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See the wavelength is\nabout 13 nanometers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1918750,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today we use 13.5."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1921370,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this was actually the first\npaper in 1988, in the US."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1925770,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in 1989, there was also a\npaper from a Japanese guy called"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1932090,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hiroo Kinoshita."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1933770,
    "dDurationMs": 4190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kinoshita published a paper look\nat this soft X-ray reduction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1937960,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in lithography using\nmultilayer mirrors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1939940,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Very direct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1941040,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he shows this is his\nsetup a Schwarzschild optics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1944360,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a reflecting mask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1946200,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And these were the\nresults 0.5 micron lines"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1951200,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and spaces from a\nmicron line spaces mass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1955180,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's an 8x reduction camera."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1958680,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The wavelength used was 12.4."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1961140,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he could not have used\nMorley's PSI multilayers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1964740,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a different multilayer\nbecause this is just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1967560,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "below the absorption\nedge of silicon at 12.5."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1972640,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this wasn't his first paper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1975260,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His first paper was actually\nthree years before, in 1986,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1979940,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "published in Japanese in Japan\nat the Japan applied Physics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1984120,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Society meeting\nfor meeting 1986."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1988680,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was a."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1989700,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A, the results were much\ncruder, but this was the first,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1994660,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so we normally regard him as\nthe inventor of EUV lithography,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2000540,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "although in the US Andy\nHurley was the first one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2004700,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK, Andy actually told\nme that he did not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2007300,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "know the results\nof Kinoshita, which"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2009740,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I believe this was\npublished entirely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2013100,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in Japanese back\nin those days, it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2016380,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wasn't translated into\nEnglish, but Kinoshita San"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2019580,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was the first one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2020600,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there was a third group, the\nBell Labs folks, the Bell Labs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2025220,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "folks, two people, originally\nAlbert wood and Bill sylvest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2030500,
    "dDurationMs": 6760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were working on\na 37.5 sodium laser."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2037260,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They thought that,\nhey, we could make"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2039300,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this to do photolithography,\nsuch a small wavelength."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2044060,
    "dDurationMs": 5119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they actually proposed at\nfirst the offner type of optics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2049179,
    "dDurationMs": 3661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They want to coat the offner\noptics with multilayers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2052840,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then use that\nto do lithography."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2054840,
    "dDurationMs": 2799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, for some reason,\nthat wasn't what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2057639,
    "dDurationMs": 4281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Bell Labs subsequently did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2061920,
    "dDurationMs": 6700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Subsequently, the results came\nfrom not the after optics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2068620,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the Schwarzschild optics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2071000,
    "dDurationMs": 2659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Jeff Bowker right here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2073659,
    "dDurationMs": 841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second name."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2074500,
    "dDurationMs": 3179,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you were heavily\ninvolved in this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2077679,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this paper was\npublished in 1990."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2081679,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Schwarzschild optics\nat a wavelength of 14,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2086179,
    "dDurationMs": 1761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very close to\ntoday's wavelengths."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2087940,
    "dDurationMs": 2299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But they use the\ntransmission mask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2090239,
    "dDurationMs": 4041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a membrane mask,\nnot the multilayer mask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2094280,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But look at the results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2096100,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Look at the results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2098080,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pitch equal to 100 nanometer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2100760,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back in those days, those\nwere the best results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2103980,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was a student."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2105020,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I said, wow, my advisor Hank\nSmith tried to downplay this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2108840,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2109340,
    "dDurationMs": 240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2109580,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But they got a lot\nof aberrations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2111220,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it doesn't matter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2112140,
    "dDurationMs": 750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't matter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2112890,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because to do this,\nthey had to open up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2115250,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is normally is 0.08."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2118710,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "0.08 if you put\nin the formula you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2121150,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "couldn't get this because\nthis is on axis illumination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2124390,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the smallest K1 is 0.5."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2127290,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in order to get this they\nopen up this aperture to 0.16"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2131950,
    "dDurationMs": 540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2132490,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In order to get\nthat of course that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2134230,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "introduces a lot of\naberrations but that's OK."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2137030,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They published this OK."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2139470,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those were the best results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2141510,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then in the mid\n90s, Intel led by Intel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2146310,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something called the chief\ntechnology guy at Intel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2149530,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those days, they formed this\nthing called the EUV, LLC"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2154510,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and EUV, LLC was formed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2158530,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then members joined\nand those members"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2160670,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were competitors of Intel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2162990,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nonetheless, they joined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2164250,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They bought shares of EUV,\nLLC at $5 million per share"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2168910,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AMD, IBM, Infinium micro model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2172370,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are joined and\nSEMATECH joined,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2175550,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then the money was\npulled and farmed out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2179770,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to virtual National Laboratory\nLawrence Livermore, Sandia"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2184930,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Lawrence Berkeley\nheaded by Dave Attwood."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2188430,
    "dDurationMs": 7580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here And this was the time\nwhen ASML joined EUV, LLC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2196010,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Euv, LLC was critical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2198390,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before EUV, LLC, you might say,\nOK, we have disparate groups."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2203670,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were gangsters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2204830,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is organized crime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2207290,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And a lot of IP a\nlot of good work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2212450,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But EUV LLC ramped\ndown in 2002, 2003."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2218050,
    "dDurationMs": 7140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, when EUV LLC ramped\ndown, ASML ramped up in 2006,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2225190,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we shipped first\ntwo EUV machines,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2227790,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these called ADT alpha."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2229940,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Demo tools one went to Albany."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2233440,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other one went\nto our partner IMEC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2236660,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this picture was\ntaken April of 2007."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2240600,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Two was accepted in a\nyear later of course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2245600,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Took a long time to have this\ntool installed and debugged."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2249000,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it used a discharge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2250900,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Produced a plasma source which\nwe no longer use nowadays."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2254920,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So these were the\nfirst two tools."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2257640,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The pictures are\nfrom the second tool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2259460,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At IMEC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2260720,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't have a picture\nof the Albany tool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2263800,
    "dDurationMs": 7420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then from that point\nonward we developed 6,100."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2271220,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are the next\ngeneration beyond the ADT."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2275360,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Six of them were developed\nand went to various companies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2279640,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And my former company TSMC\ngot the number 6 tool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2284560,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The number 6 tool\ncame to Taiwan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2287700,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This picture was taken by\nme on the tarmac of taoyuan"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2291500,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "International Airport."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2292800,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Summer of 1911."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2294580,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then four months\nlater, this was almost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2297500,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "installed in our fab fab 12."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2301860,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Inside TSMC shinshu R\u0026D fab."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2305620,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now how good could we do\nwith this 0.25 micron R\u0026D tool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2312300,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was a photo of\nthe lowest metal layer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2319420,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a pitch of 46 nanometers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2322180,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is after hard mask\netched through right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2326180,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was intended to be\nthe design of 10 nanometer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2332620,
    "dDurationMs": 2598,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "generation, but\nit did not happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2335218,
    "dDurationMs": 542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Look at this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2335760,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a two\ndimensional design."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2337440,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the end, the 10 nanometer was\na 1D design because EUV could"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2341140,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not make it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2342280,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And TSMC we had to continue\nwith immersion lithography."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2347960,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we changed it to a\nself-aligned etch process"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2354160,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a 1D design."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2355600,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But had EUV been ready, we\nwould have continued with the 2D"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2359560,
    "dDurationMs": 580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "design."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2360140,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK, that's another story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2362120,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I want to just give\nyou a sneak preview."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2364660,
    "dDurationMs": 6780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "11 years later, we could do this\nwith the high-na EUV machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2371440,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Again, a 2D design."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2373320,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now is 0.55."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2375660,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is from our first machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2378400,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see the pitch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2380360,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The pitch was 46."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2381780,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The pitch is now 22."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2384800,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's progress."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2386220,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Again, this is etched\ninto a hard mask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2389200,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2389940,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the EUV development at TSMC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2394120,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a chronology of\nEUV development at TSMC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2398360,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not only did we work with\nASML very closely and tested"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2403960,
    "dDurationMs": 5190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "EUV on 10 nanometer, 7\nnanometer, 5 nanometer test"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2409150,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "layers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2409930,
    "dDurationMs": 6380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we also had to participate\nin infrastructure development."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2416310,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Imec has always been a member."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2418590,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We rejoined the\nSEMATECH Berkeley Lab,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2421210,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of course sorry, the Metz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2424830,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we also joined\nthe adac in Japan"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2426870,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to develop the help develop the\nactinic blank inspector and also"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2431470,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the co-funding of EUV\ndevelopment with ASML"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2435030,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to ASML along with\nIntel and Samsung."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2438190,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was led by me of course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2441370,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then in 2017 I left\nand joined ASML."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2446430,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2019, this is when EUV went\ninto high volume production."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2451350,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As you can see that this was a\npaper published by TSMC at IDM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2456310,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "2019, where they announced that\nthe 7 nanometer plus node has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2462950,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had been developed and used\nlayers of EUV lithography."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2468710,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And of course, they also\nannounced that the next year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2471330,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the 5 nanometer node\nwill have more EUV layers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2475690,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is the first\npart of the story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2478590,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK from the beginning to high\nvolume manufacturing in 2019."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2484310,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let me move on\nto the second part."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2486930,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK last slide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2488530,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is what ASML did right\n222 alpha demo tools in 2006."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2493610,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And a bunch of six of\nthem R\u0026D tools in 2010."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2498310,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Starting in 2010."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2499630,
    "dDurationMs": 5860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in 2013 ASML did the third\ngeneration 3,300 B 3300b lens"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2505490,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "design is the same as the 3,100,\nbut the Germans thought that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2509330,
    "dDurationMs": 4990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with better fabrication, they\ncould enlarge the DNA from 0.25"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2514320,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to 0.33."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2516010,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is the Na that\nwe're using until now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2520290,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All the subsequent machines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2522340,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "0.33 machines all use\nthe same lens design."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2525540,
    "dDurationMs": 6460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sorry and then in 2019, we\nhave the 3400c the workhorse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2532000,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then all these\nmachines are being retired."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2535940,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But 3400c still working."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2538500,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then to 2021 we\ncame out with 3600d."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2542600,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now that was the first part."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2545740,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Second part is the\ncurrent status."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2548080,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First the 0.33 Na,\nwhich is the workhorse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2551400,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then the 0.55 the\nnext generation high Na."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2555440,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is our\nlatest 0.33 machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2560580,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The 3,800 right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2562420,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've already gone\nthrough 3,000 403,600."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2565060,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now the 3,800."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2566540,
    "dDurationMs": 4205,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The 3,800 machine is\nquite a nice machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2570745,
    "dDurationMs": 1375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And of course,\nthe throughput has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2572120,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "been increased to\n220 wafers per hour"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2575680,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at 30 millijoules per\ncentimeter square."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2577740,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You always have to\nspecify the dose"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2579360,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if the dose is very\nhigh, of course,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2581160,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the throughput comes down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2584420,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have a 500 Watt\nEUV source now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2588940,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then we have a very\nlow aberration projection"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2592260,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "optics here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2594100,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the 3,800."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2598000,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how did it do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2599440,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well first, let me show\nyou some overlay number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2603860,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a dedicated\nchalk overlay"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2606420,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning that the wafer\ngets on one Chuck"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2609460,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you expose it and it\ngets on the same Chuck,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2612680,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you expose it again,\nand you measure the overlay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2615520,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this dedicated overlay\nnumber is extremely good,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2619580,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "0.50.6 nanometer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2622900,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not talking about one point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2625000,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each field has 49\npoints 76 fields"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2629260,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "per wafer times 12 wafers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2632500,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These numbers came\nfrom these many points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2637280,
    "dDurationMs": 1850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is not just a 3 sigma."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2639130,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's mean plus minus 3 sigma."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2641270,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the whole thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2643090,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And match machine overlay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2646210,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Meaning that overlay read\non two different machines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2650430,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This one is not working."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2652350,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's OK on two\ndifferent machines,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2655870,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but of the same\ntype of both 3,800."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2658190,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we get 0.9 and 0.8."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2661190,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Still very good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2662530,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK still very good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2664370,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can see that we\nwere below the spec OK."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2669970,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now what's the reliability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2672230,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, are they\nall always down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2674110,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, no they're mostly up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2675890,
    "dDurationMs": 5965,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The availability is 93.5%\nworldwide on all the machines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2681855,
    "dDurationMs": 1375,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the average\navailability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2683230,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's already very good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2684710,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not as good as the\ndeep-v machines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2686310,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Deep-v machines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2686990,
    "dDurationMs": 580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2687570,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The availability is\nabove 95% So yes, we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2691130,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "continue to work on it to\nimprove the availability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2694670,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how many of these\nmachines are there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2698390,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's the cumulative number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2700590,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the end of Q4 2024, about\n270 machines are in the field"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2707150,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all running OK."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2709230,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "34 603,800."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2711570,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These three types, the 3,300\nhave been retired about 270"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2716430,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "machines by the\nend of last year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2718790,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all working either\nin R\u0026D or production."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2722830,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, how many wafers\ncan you produce a day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2726730,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All these questions are\nasked by our customers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2729550,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The number of wafers that we\nproduce today on average is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2733710,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about 3,000 on a single system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2738150,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can do a little better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2739770,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's between 3,000 and 3,500."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2744110,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, we're going to\ncontinue to improve this number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2748230,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2749190,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So where are we going from here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2751650,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, of course\nscaling has slowed down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2755670,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it has not stopped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2757770,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So scaling will continue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2760450,
    "dDurationMs": 7040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And because of that, we started\nto OK, this is another thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2767490,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're not scaling as\nsteeply as before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2772610,
    "dDurationMs": 7480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This slope, this was the slope\ndown to 3 nanometer generation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2780090,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can see an\ninflection point, a kink."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2782850,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Starting from 3 nanometer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2785050,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It comes down more gradually."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2787070,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're never going to go\nback to this kind of slope."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2790690,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However we have not stopped OK."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2793830,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was really a turning point\nat 3:00 nanometer generation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2798850,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because of that, we 10 years\nago, we started to develop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2805250,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a hyena system 0.55 because\nthere is a need for scaling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2812690,
    "dDurationMs": 3950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good that good thing that\nthe slope has not stopped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2816640,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK, so system design for years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2820520,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Module manufacturing\nstarted in 2018."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2824280,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2012 we integrated\nthe modules."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2827440,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the source."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2828340,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is if right here\nintermediate focus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2831380,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The scanner will be here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2832880,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the vessel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2834800,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The vessel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2836120,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the illuminator\npicture of the illuminator"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2839840,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "made by Zeiss."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2843640,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the wafer stage we\nmake in veldhoven, Holland."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2847720,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The radical stage\nmade here in the US."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2850340,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Connecticut Wilton, Connecticut."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2852280,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK, so you put all\nthese things together,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2854860,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we put together the first\nmachine in 2023, in veldhoven."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2860240,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then in the."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2862860,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then the next machine I'll\nshow you in the next slide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2866220,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then the next\nmachine in veldhoven"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2868160,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the machine for the\njoint lab with IMEC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2871520,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But before this happened,\nwe shipped a machine to our."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2876860,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK, first let me talk\nabout the optics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2879820,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the biggest piece."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2881460,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the largest\nmirror facing the wafer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2885340,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This mirror has a\ndiameter of 1 meter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2888580,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and an aberration\nnumber of 20 picometers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2892500,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK yeah, that's\nactually shown here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2895980,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first machine\nactually went to Intel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2902660,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right before the end of 2023."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2905620,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, it takes a few."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2907920,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "747 to ship the whole machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2910600,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is just one of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2912380,
    "dDurationMs": 6260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it was going into Intel's\nR\u0026D fab in Portland, Oregon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2921740,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And wrapping cranes\nas you can see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2927500,
    "dDurationMs": 980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Quite heavy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2932810,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the frame."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2934830,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the illuminator."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2935830,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here OK yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2940650,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, this video\ncame from Intel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2942790,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this is the\nend of the video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2944310,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can see that the wafer\nstage is not in there yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2947530,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't know why they had this\nplastic thing to cover it up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2950450,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The lens is already in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2952150,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The illuminator is\nnot in there yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2954530,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the radical stage on\ntop is not in there yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2957590,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the source is\nalready in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2959810,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this picture\ntells a lot of story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2963450,
    "dDurationMs": 6280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is inside Intel's\nR\u0026D fab in Oregon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2969730,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then, of course, the next\nmachine we put it in veldhoven."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2974030,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a joint lab with IMEC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2975910,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Normally a machine would go to\nIMEC, but for the first machine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2980490,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in order to maintain\nit more easily,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2982350,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we put it in veldhoven, smack\nin the middle of our factory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2986090,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And let me see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2987210,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Get the animation started."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2992510,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, this is real."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2994750,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The machine made\nit to a Tor track."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2998150,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there's a metrology room\nwith all the ancillary stuff"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3002750,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is located."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3003970,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is the high end\nlab we have at IMEC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3006790,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then the next few slides,\nI'll show results from this lab."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3012070,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First result is the DRAM, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3015890,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Drams the most critical\ntwo layers in DRAM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3019630,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are the hexagonal\nstorage node lithography."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3025350,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the state of the\nart is right here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3028870,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's 34."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3030070,
    "dDurationMs": 7320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This has just entered HVM\nhigh volume manufacturing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3037390,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Leading edge DRAM makers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3039010,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see with pitch 34."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3040830,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Low-high and low\ncan still do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3044170,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, it's done with low."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3045830,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nowadays in manufacturing OK."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3049090,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Hina would have\ndone it with ease."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3052610,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then, of course, when\nyou go beyond page 34 Lo,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3058290,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it will become much\nmore difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3061770,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The The equivalent dose\nwould be very high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3067910,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The reason is because\nyou could not make"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3070450,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "use of the full illuminator."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3072570,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You lose light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3074690,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So equivalently that means the\ndose is higher with high Na."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3078470,
    "dDurationMs": 760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3079230,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You go on to pitch 28 and below."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3082210,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is the other layer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3084370,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are two layers right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3085630,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One storage node, which\nis a positive tone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3087710,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And a negative tone is\nthe storage node pad"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3090090,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that sits underneath\nthe storage node."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3093010,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The capacitors again using low\nat pitch 32 are very difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3098750,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Very difficult. With this\nthing is more difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3102110,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The reason is that it has the\nperiphery circuit, the subwoofer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3104890,
    "dDurationMs": 5670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "driver and the sense amplifiers\nin one shot with hayana."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3110560,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Very good. adi?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3112640,
    "dDurationMs": 6540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After this is after H and at\n28 after H. It looks good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3119180,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So hayana has got\na lot of potential."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3121460,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not in HVM yet, but we\nhope that it will be HVM soon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3126360,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now this is logic, OK."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3128300,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Logic circuit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3129580,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The hardest layer\nto print is metal 0."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3133240,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the lowest metal layer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3134900,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now it's printed\nwith the low 0.33"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3137760,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with two or three\nmultiple exposures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3142700,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Purple is one where\nBrown is another one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3145060,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then you have\nthese cut layers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3147800,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you were to\nexpose it with hayana"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3150800,
    "dDurationMs": 1743,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you could do this in one shot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3152543,
    "dDurationMs": 1417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the interest\nof time, I'm going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3153960,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to go through just to show\nyou this result from IMEC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3157720,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A pitch equal to 19,\nwhich we're not there yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3160900,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK we're at pitch 23 right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3162900,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At three nanometer\nnode, pitch 19"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3165160,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will be future node\nnote with a tip to tip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3167880,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The tip to tip is another\nvery important metric."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3171660,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is single shot\nEUV lithography."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3175740,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not only can we do metal layers,\nbut also the contact layers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3179520,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are 30 nanometer contact\nlayers from center to center,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3184360,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the nominal CD is 15."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3187620,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is after lithography\nand this is after etch OK."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3192420,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I mean, how best\ncan you do this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3198580,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's the limit of this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3200240,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well I want to show you a slide\nthat has a very small pitch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3207360,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is 8 nanometer half pitch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3209080,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So 16 nanometer pitch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3210680,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you put it in the\nformula the K1 is 0.33."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3214560,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Still we're not close\nto K1 equal to 0.25."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3217680,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you can see we could do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3219720,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But of course, the image\nis of low contrast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3223500,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How do we."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3225850,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This cannot be in\nthe manufacturing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3228170,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The contrast has\nto be a lot higher."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3230490,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how do we increase\nthe contracts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3232390,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this will lead to the\nnext part of the talk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3234790,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd like to invite\nmy colleague Ronald."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3240050,
    "dDurationMs": 700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3244570,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tony and."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3247650,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Remember that Tony\ntalked about customers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3250690,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "asking tough questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3252350,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you get good resolution\nand can you make it cheaper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3256750,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's ultimately\nthe business"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3258410,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we're in better resolution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3261090,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tony talked about the\nformula that the minimum half"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3264090,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pitch is K1 lambda over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3267450,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in general try to go\nto a shorter wavelength."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3271450,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's always very complicated\nto go from 193 to 13.5"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3276770,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what was the timeline."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3279370,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How many years did\nyou say 35 years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3282270,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we're going to stick with\n13.5 nanometers for quite"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3286190,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a while."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3287070,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next thing that you\ncan do is go to a larger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3289590,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you already saw\nhow expensive that is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3291650,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then you have the\nthird factor, the K1."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3294830,
    "dDurationMs": 6020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I kind of feel a little\nbit pretentious being here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3300850,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because then we start talking\nabout computational lithography"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3304630,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and who am I daring to show\nup here at Berkeley, where"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3309110,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one of your professors,\nAndy neureuter"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3311550,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he's really the godfather of\ncomputational lithography."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3315210,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm basically\npreaching to the choir."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3318750,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But allow me anyway to share\nmy view on some of this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3323310,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Obviously, we stand on the\nshoulders of many Giants"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3327630,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that have helped with developing\na lot of the theory all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3330430,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the way from Fresnel, Fourier,\nMaxwell, Helmholtz, Ernst"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3334750,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Abbe there, this\nguy here that was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3338990,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one of the first chief\nscientists of Zeiss,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3342150,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "did a lot of work on microscopy\nand developed it from there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3349130,
    "dDurationMs": 820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What did he say."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3349950,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He say in 1873 already."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3352870,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey, the minimum pitch is 1/2\ntimes the wavelength divided"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3357570,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by the sine of that opening\nangle that we now call the."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3362010,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he didn't have the\nrefractive index yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3364590,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now we say that n times\nthe sine of that angle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3367290,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the numerical aperture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3369530,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But isn't it remarkable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3372810,
    "dDurationMs": 7080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since 1873 to the day of\ntoday, a very simple formula"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3379890,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has governed our roadmap, and\nthe rest was simply technology."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3385530,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, technology is\nnot always simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3388890,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lin from TSMC said,\nhey, lambda and Na,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3394790,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's physics and that's\ngeometry of your lenses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3397690,
    "dDurationMs": 3850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that K1, that's all kind of\nillumination tricks chemistry,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3401540,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "resist contrast,\naberrations, and mask tricks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3405280,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the minimum value that\nyou can accomplish is 0.25."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3409320,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm going to talk\nabout what can we all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3411320,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do to reduce that K1 if we want\nto do that with computation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3417200,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It starts with I need to\nhave a good model for what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3420120,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "am I actually getting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3421220,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I need a forward\nmodel with which"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3424160,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can predict what is the\nquality of the imaging"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3426880,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I get and that good model\nthat will involve a MAST model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3432960,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I need to see what is\nhappening in my optics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3436440,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is the reaction\nof my resist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3438620,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a lot of chemistry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3440040,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And ultimately,\nI don't care what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3441840,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the pattern is, am I resist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3443340,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want it to have it\nin a device layer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3445740,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I need an edge model that\nbecomes my forward model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3450080,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And a lot of effort\nhas gone into how"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3451960,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do I make that forward\nmodel as good as I can."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3456840,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we continue to\nimprove with that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3459220,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "More and more physics,\nmore and more chemistry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3461760,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And at some point in\ntime, we said, hey,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3464020,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AI is starting to take off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3465760,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And perhaps when we have a\nlot of good measurements,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3468340,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can develop an AI\nmodel that can predict"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3471460,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what I will get, even\nwithout fully understanding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3474700,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why that is what I will get and\nall of that is being employed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3479580,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But once I have\nsuch a good model,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3481640,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can go and play\nall kinds of tricks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3484180,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can make a little\nmanufacturing check"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3487740,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where with a little layer\nand a little model that I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3490780,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have developed, I can\nnow say, what am I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3492540,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going to get on the wafer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3493880,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And is that what I wanted\nin the first place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3497620,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another option is that I say,\nhey, I have a little layer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3501300,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I have measurements\non what is the wafer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3503600,
    "dDurationMs": 5260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can calibrate that model\nor I have a little model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3508860,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know what I want on the wafer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3511220,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do I need to\nput on my reticle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3513580,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that I get, in the end, what\nI wanted in the first place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3517180,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you contributed\nquite a bit of that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3520070,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's where the field of\ninverse lithography and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3523110,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to talk about\na different one today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3525230,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's this one here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3526650,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know what I want on the wafer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3528510,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How can I optimize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3530030,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is the pattern that\nI put on the little layer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3532730,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how do I\ninstruct my scanner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3536070,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is the illumination that\nI will use on the scanner"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3539530,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to maximize the contrast to\nget the best possible results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3544850,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, when we talk\nabout illumination,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3546990,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let me talk for a moment\nabout an illumination system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3551450,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trick is what I\nwould like to have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3553970,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is very, very uniform\nillumination of my mask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3558530,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in order to play\nwith interference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3562290,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to play with\ndiffraction and be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3564770,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "able to manipulate exactly what\nis the interference pattern"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3568330,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I get on the wafer,\nI need to make sure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3570930,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that this is spatially\ncoherent light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3575610,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how do we do that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3577150,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We create this\nso-called 4f system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3580190,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A guy Kohler invented this by\nhaving this four lens system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3585990,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I can create is, for every\npoint in the light source,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3589990,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is one particular set of\nplanar waves that hits the mask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3595230,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if I imagine myself\nsitting on the mask"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3599270,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I look back at the\nillumination, imagine a circle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3604550,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I could get light from\nthat whole circle at me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3607570,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That would be a cone of light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3609750,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I could have light just coming\nfrom the center of that point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3613250,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That would be one planar wave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3615710,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will also show you that\nI can have light coming"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3617830,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from there and from\nthere, and then I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3620350,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "get very particular diffraction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3622330,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's all the optimization\nthat we're going to do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3628270,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here you see\nthat a little bit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3630390,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for every point in my source\nplane in the illumination I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3634470,
    "dDurationMs": 1310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now get a number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3635780,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got plane waves onto the\nmask that leads to diffraction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3641820,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the diffraction orders are\ncaptured by the objective lens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3645040,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the bigger this lens, the\nbigger these opening angles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3648400,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the more of these\ndiffraction patterns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3650620,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I capture, and\nthe better will be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3652580,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the reconstruction of the\nimage here on the image plane."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3656000,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's basically Fourier optics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3658980,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's look a little\nbit more at diffraction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3661260,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for those of you\nthat are not totally"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3662900,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "familiar with that, Mr.\nHuygens already said, hey,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3666520,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you have light\nhitting an opening,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3669420,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each point here starts to act\nas a source of spherical waves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3674900,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's really the path optical\npath length differences that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3678260,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then create this pattern\nhere, where in some directions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3681820,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I end up getting light,\nand in other directions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3684460,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I do not get light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3686000,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And those are called\nthe diffraction orders."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3688900,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In essence, if I\nlook at my aperture,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3692340,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the mask, and I think of\nthat as a repeating pattern."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3697440,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can take the Fourier\ntransform of that pattern,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3700300,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and every diffraction\norder encodes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3702440,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one of the Fourier components."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3704880,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can think of\nthe lens as a filter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3707640,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How many of the\nFourier components"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3709440,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can I capture that lead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3711700,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Help me reconstruct the\npattern of the mask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3714660,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now on the wafer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3718120,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in certain directions, look\nat this wave from this opening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3724320,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This one here had just this\none was one wavelength to here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3728680,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this one was two."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3729820,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This one was three."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3730960,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in this particular direction,\nall of these waves are in phase"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3736200,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they contribute to\npositive interference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3739420,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is called\nthe Bragg condition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3743360,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each of these\ndiffraction patterns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3745120,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can now project\nhere in the pupil"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3747760,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "plane for the lens\nas a particular spot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3751760,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when these\ndiffraction patterns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3754180,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "start to fall outside\nthe aperture of the lens,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3756960,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the numerical aperture\nof the lens, then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3759500,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no longer does it contribute\nto the image formation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3764740,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the wafer level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3765840,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It basically looks like\nsomething like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3768340,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My zeroth order."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3769480,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The light that straight\ngoes through these waves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3772880,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They lead to no contrast here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3775580,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first order is a wave\nwith the same frequency"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3779420,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the pattern, the second\norder is triple the frequency,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3784280,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "et cetera."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3786340,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's how in the end,\nI reconstruct the image"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3789580,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the wafer plane."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3792540,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going a little bit fast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3793960,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now Abe was the\none that said so now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3799700,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my challenge is I know\nwhat I want as a wafer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3806020,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a light intensity\non the wafer plane."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3809460,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My challenge is to\noptimize the source here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3812490,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that for every source point,\nthe waves hitting the mask"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3817570,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with how they go through\nthe lens and all the path"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3820330,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "length differences,\nhow that all adds up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3823410,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to this spatial\nfrequency on the mask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3828730,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me show that to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3830390,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Much simpler."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3831730,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here we have that\none central point"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3834730,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I was talking about\nthis large illumination disk"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3839210,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hitting a mask, creating\ndiffraction patterns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3842830,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each of these\ndiffraction patterns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3844450,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are within the pupil\nplane of the lens,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3846930,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and therefore they contribute\nto this interference pattern"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3850810,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the wafer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3853210,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What happens now when I\nstart to reduce the pitch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3859050,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see that some\nof the diffraction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3861250,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now moves further out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3863410,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The contrast in my\nimage starts to reduce."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3866450,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm now at a CD basically\nof 0.5 lambda over an A."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3871870,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I now go any\nfurther with shrinking,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3876710,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "suddenly those outer points no\nlonger are captured by the lens,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3881190,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I have 0 contrast left."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3884310,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's no imaging."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3886190,
    "dDurationMs": 780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But wait a minute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3886970,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can do some tricks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3889350,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What if instead of\nusing that point"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3891270,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "source, if I use a whole disk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3897310,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you see that right\nhere at the edge,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3900390,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is, again, a little bit of\noverlap between the zeroth order"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3903790,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the first order."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3905230,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I start to see a little\nbit of the reconstruction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3907950,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of my image at the wafer plane."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3914070,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the contrast is\nvery low because there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3916510,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a lot of light from the\ncenter that doesn't really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3921590,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "contribute anything\nto the interference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3925070,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what if I could\nmove that light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3927850,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That would improve my contrast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3930660,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I go and use what we\ncall annular illumination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3934700,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead of the light coming\nout of that whole disk,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3936920,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I now see it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3937880,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I look from the mask\nback at the illumination,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3941800,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would see it come from a ring\nand I get much better contrast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3947100,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, if I can do that,\nwhy not do even more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3950500,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because that light here at the\nedges is also not contributing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3954660,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is where the positive\ninterference come from."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3957560,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let me remove that also."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3960340,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I get even better contrast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3962820,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I have something\ncalled dipole illumination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3966780,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is what a\nlot of the fancy stuff"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3970900,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is happening nowadays."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3972740,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can basically create with our\nillumination arbitrary shapes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3977900,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the illumination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3979360,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what is the\nbest illumination"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3981140,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that will for the\nset of patterns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3983380,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lead to the best reconstruction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3989480,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How does that then work out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3991520,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I have a full\nchip design, I will"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3993720,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pick a bunch of critical\npatterns, the ones"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3996720,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I care about most."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3999920,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For those, I will start\ndoing this optimization."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4002900,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have a forward model,\nI keep calculating,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4006240,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can use inverse\nlithography and try"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4008600,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to do a more direct\ncalculation, but in the end,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4011740,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will end up with\nan illumination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4014280,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see that\nthere at the top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4016400,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with that\nillumination I can."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4020080,
    "dDurationMs": 940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah there you go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4021020,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We start to improve,\niterate on the illumination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4024740,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can now start seeing\nthat as I project I get"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4027720,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a cleaner and cleaner image."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4030040,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once I have the very\nbest illumination,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4032260,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can say, OK, now let me use\nwith this illumination OPC"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4036640,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to improve the whole mask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4038640,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if I did the original\nselection of the patterns"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4041560,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I optimized for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4042940,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, and those were really\nthe most critical ones"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4046180,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then this illumination\nwill actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4048540,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "work for the whole chip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4053020,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how does that\noptimization algorithm work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4056940,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Basically we tend\nto look at hey,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4060360,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to this is what the\ndesigner drew this square thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4065900,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now we know that we can\nnever print something square."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4068840,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's always\nfinite resolution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4071340,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if I would try to optimize\ndirectly to that square shape,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4076300,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my total cost function, which\nis all the errors added up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4080160,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would be completely\ndominated by these corners."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4082600,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's artificial."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4083960,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we say, theoretically\nthe best that I can do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4087020,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is some target that\nI can draw here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4089740,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me now try to get the\nmask and the illumination"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4093380,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that I get as close as\npossible to what I think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4096020,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is possible, and I want to do\nthat for a range of conditions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4099960,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not just for nominal, but\nalso for a little bit more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4104020,
    "dDurationMs": 1270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or less dose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4105290,
    "dDurationMs": 2279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dose is never\nperfectly controlled."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4107569,
    "dDurationMs": 2281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A little bit more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4109850,
    "dDurationMs": 4259,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some focus variation and the\nmask making is also not perfect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4114109,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I take all these\nvariances into account"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4116729,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and make sure that I\narrive at something that is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4119529,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "robust under these variations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4123569,
    "dDurationMs": 2761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here are some of the\nmasks that I will skip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4126330,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here are some of the\nmath that I will also"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4128370,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "skip that determines\nhow all of that works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4131630,
    "dDurationMs": 1939,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what I wanted\nto point out here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4133569,
    "dDurationMs": 3601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is there are actually\ntwo terms here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4137170,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is this here that\ncaptures some of the effects"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4140130,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from non chemically\namplified resist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4142850,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I want right now to\nfocus your attention here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4145850,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for a moment at this term."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4147970,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a mask 3D effect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4150210,
    "dDurationMs": 3399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what is a mask 3D effect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4153609,
    "dDurationMs": 3841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll go fast I'm nearly done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4157450,
    "dDurationMs": 2739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is one of those\npoles of the illumination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4160189,
    "dDurationMs": 2621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The zeroth order is\nlight that goes through."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4162810,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It goes to my wafer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4164910,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is the first diffraction\norder and it goes here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4168870,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, because of\nelectromagnetic effects here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4172870,
    "dDurationMs": 3239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is an extra phase\ndifference between these two."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4176109,
    "dDurationMs": 2141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's called a mask 3D effect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4178250,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that means that instead of\na really good reconstruction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4181990,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of all my Fourier\ncomponents, imagine that I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4184870,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have a Fourier transform."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4187130,
    "dDurationMs": 2099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I'm a little bit\noff on the amplitude"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4189229,
    "dDurationMs": 2721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of some of these components,\nor I'm a little bit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4191950,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "off on the phase of these\ncomponents that would start"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4194950,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to affect your reconstruction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4197230,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So our goal is to reconstruct\nhow can I do that correctly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4201530,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because my one pole remember\nthe dipole illumination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4204910,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was one pole."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4206310,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as a result of\nthat phase difference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4208950,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you actually get a\nshift in your mask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4211370,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see this phi minus phi be\nthat phase difference leads"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4214870,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a shift in your mask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4216490,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead of the\nintensity being focused"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4219030,
    "dDurationMs": 4150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around the ideal position,\nit has shifted a little bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4223180,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the other pole\nwill have this shift"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4225860,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the other direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4227220,
    "dDurationMs": 6800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So my total image is now the\nsum of two distributions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4234020,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If they were perfectly aligned\nI would have a nice sharp image,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4237680,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they are not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4238640,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the image fades I get\na reduction in contrast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4243300,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What could I do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4244540,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Could I do something smart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4247020,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What if I have the illumination\nand instead of the dipole"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4253340,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "here, I move this pole\ndown a little bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4256120,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I move this pole\nup a little bit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4258380,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and in my lens I can now\ncompensate for the mask's 3D"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4262340,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "effects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4263260,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because this order here, these\ndiffraction orders here and here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4269660,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are the zeroth order."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4272680,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now I can have\nthe one pole shift"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4276980,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the left, the other one\na little bit to the right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4279720,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now they overlap\nagain perfectly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4282880,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now that's simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4284560,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I only have to do with a 2D\npattern, what we can now do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4289140,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's why we\nhave computers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4291380,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can actually generalize this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4293340,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I can take an arbitrary\nmask pattern for logic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4296720,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I can say, hey, what would\nnow be the very best aberration"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4302200,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pattern in my lens\nthat would make"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4304680,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that all these images\nfrom these poles overlap"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4307520,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as well as possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4308920,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's what you see here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4310800,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is what I just explained\nfor a simple if all I look at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4314440,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is lens is lines and spaces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4318240,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is for the actual\nmask pattern here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4322720,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as a result, I get much\nbetter exposure, latitude"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4326000,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and much better adaptive\nfocus in my final imaging."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4330080,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I hope that with\nthat, I've given you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4331800,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a little bit of a flavor on\nhow we can use computation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4335080,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to optimize the\nsettings on the scanner,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4338680,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "both from an\nillumination perspective"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4340780,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as well as aberrations\nin the lens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4343140,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We try to minimize\nthe aberrations,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4345560,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and sometimes we introduce them\non purpose to correct for mass"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4349420,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "3D effects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4351340,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, with all of that said,\nlet me finish up the last part."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4355060,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just a slide on the\nroadmap and the outlook."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4359420,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Remember the best\npossible resolution"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4362900,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the lowest possible price."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4365060,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's look at we've looked\nat the best possible resolution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4370200,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Reduced the lambda,\nincrease DNA decrease K1."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4375540,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's now look for a moment\nthat cost of the technology"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4379580,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the productivity the\nEUV light source."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4384380,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We now we've recently announced\nthat our latest results"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4388940,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in San Diego, we\ncan get one kilowatt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4391780,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of power out of our dose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4393680,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And remember what Tony\nsaid in the beginning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4397060,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we struggled to get one Watt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4399970,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then at some point we\nwere really excited"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4401970,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we got 10 watts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4404170,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "TSMC told us that\nwhen we hit 80w,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4408130,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can go into\nvolume production."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4409990,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was in 2019."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4412690,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was 2 watts or that\nwas 281 was 2014 was 214."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4418470,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4419430,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sorry so that's when they said,\nOK, now we are serious about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4424310,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We think that you can get there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4426090,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And by 2019 we were at 250."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4429970,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We now have in our hands\ndemonstrations that we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4433530,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can actually hit 1 kilowatt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4437610,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another way of reducing\nthe cost of the system"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4441170,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is by having more\ncommonality between EUV."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4445090,
    "dDurationMs": 6600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sorry, between the .33 and a\nsystem and the .55 and a system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4451690,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we have a roadmap\non how we can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4454490,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "create a more common\nplatform that we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4457390,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will do that with also an\noption to in the future,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4462610,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "start looking at 0.75,\nfor which we already"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4466150,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have some prototype designs and\nwhere we can get at the end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4471950,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or here is an example of with\n13.5 nanometer EUV light from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4477070,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Paul scherrer Institute\ninterferometric EUV lithography,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4481190,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where you do not\nhave mass 3D effects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4483610,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we could really control\neverything can see that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4488030,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, there are\nalready some evidence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4490070,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that half pitches of about\nfive or six nanometer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4494070,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a absolute theoretical\nmaximum would be possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4497590,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we still have\nquite a ways to go"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4499550,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we can scale more\nthan where we are today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4504670,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with that, I\ncome to the end,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4507010,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I hope that I\nfulfilled my promise"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4508910,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I wouldn't be too long."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4513470,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tony, why don't you\njoin me for questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4518700,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello what happened here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4521220,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No it's fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4522220,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was supposed to\nactivate from that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4525540,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4526420,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I think it's on now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4527620,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK, so we'll take questions\nnow for both speakers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4532140,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we're open for questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4538540,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do I understand correctly that\nif the end user cares about,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4542800,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let's say, resolution just\nalong one axis, that's an easier"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4546940,
    "dDurationMs": 1492,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "problem from your perspective."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4548432,
    "dDurationMs": 1708,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that correct to\nsay, is that something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4550140,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the end users are trying\nto or you all collectively"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4553780,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are trying to leverage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4554840,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK, so let's define first\nwhat the end user is, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4558180,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the end user\nis Apple then they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4563380,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tell TSMC it's your problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4568140,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "TSMC will tell\nus, hey, do you we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4571220,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "want to use dipole\nillumination combination,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4573580,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because that gives\nthe very best contrast"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4575600,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for one dimensional patterns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4577920,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you make a light source\nwhere all of the light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4581440,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "only comes from these two\npoints in that whole disk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4585360,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, we can do\nthat pretty well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4589240,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but if you make these\nspots too small,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4592400,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can only do that by throwing\nsome of the light away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4595920,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if we throw some\nof the light away,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4597620,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then it goes at the\nexpense of productivity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4600520,
    "dDurationMs": 6540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so our newer illumination\ndesigns can use a much smaller,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4607060,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what we call a pupil fill ratio."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4608900,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's the smallest fraction\nof that whole illumination"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4612520,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "disk that you can define."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4614700,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's where I want the light\nto come from and still use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4617600,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "100% of the light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4620040,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's really a\nshared responsibility"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4623520,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between us and the customer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4626440,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But for every layer\nmetal 0, metal one,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4630860,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "metal 2 contact holes, vias."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4633550,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every layer has its\nown illumination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4636590,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And let me take your example\na little bit to an extreme."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4640150,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I want the absolute smallest\npitch in one direction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4646830,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would use a dipole with only\ntwo tiny little pieces of light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4652390,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4653830,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would now have great\ncontrast in this direction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4658990,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and 0 contrast in\nthe other direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4661170,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the only thing\nthat I can now do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4663350,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is print lines that\nare infinitely long."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4665950,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not a single designer\nis interested in that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4669030,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now what you\ncould do is well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4670650,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but if I have those\nvery long lines,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4672410,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will use a second\nexposure to cut them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4675590,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that's expensive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4677010,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Perhaps bring in these\npoles a little bit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4678930,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "regain a little bit\nof that contrast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4681330,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now I can also print\ngaps in these lines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4686350,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But how small I\ncan get that gap."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4688850,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the so-called\ntip to tip difference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4691890,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that depends on how you\noptimize the illumination"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4695130,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and how you optimize the OPC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4697290,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's a very\ninteractive discussion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4699930,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between us and our customers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4701850,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hope that answers your question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4703470,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK, here's another question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4704830,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just a quick question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4706350,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if the minimum\npitch you're expecting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4710130,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is like 90 nanometers,\nthat does bring up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4713290,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the question, what\nexactly does the metric in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4718130,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like a node name refer to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4720310,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because it's clearly not\nthe pitch of the features"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4722530,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "themselves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4724730,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Great question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4725870,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah so the node names\nright 5 nanometer node,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4729990,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "4 nanometer node\nthree nanometer node."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4732610,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back in the days that\nwe had the 45 nanometer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4735530,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "node that actually\nreally represented"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4738370,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the size of the lines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4740570,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And at some point that became\nvery increasingly difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4744770,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But people also became very\ncreative in terms of with design"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4749550,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tricks and layout tricks, I can\nget more density out of the size"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4755750,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4756870,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So think of the 5 nanometer and\nthe 4 nanometer and 3 nanometer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4761430,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now more as an indication of\nwhat is the effective transistor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4766150,
    "dDurationMs": 620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "density."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4766770,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How many transistors\ncan I get per squared"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4769990,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "per square millimeter\nor per square micron."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4772670,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's more an indication of that\ninstead of really the dimension."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4777450,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tony, anything you\nwould like to add."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4779050,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah well, historically\nRonald was right down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4783590,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to maybe 90 or 65 nanometers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4786430,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the half pitch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4787890,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you say 65, the\nhalf pitch is 65."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4791230,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But nowadays, no, it's\njust a marketing name."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4796110,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this is not recorded."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4797490,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't want my\ncustomers to hear this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4800350,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4801310,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, it's so cut this part\nout of the recording, OK."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4805830,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, it is an improvement\nover the previous generation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4809520,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But is it 2x the\ntransistor density."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4814080,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, those days are over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4816540,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK, so I'd like to ask a\nquestion about the optimization"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4821220,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "methods."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4822220,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So one of the great\nchallenges in optimization"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4825620,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is if you have a great\nmany variables to optimize,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4828400,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it gets really quite hard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4830860,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you spoke mostly about\nthe source optimization."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4836540,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there's a lot of variables\nin the source optimization."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4839980,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then you also\nmention the so-called OPC"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4843340,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is the mask optimization."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4845500,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that adds even\nmore variables"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4847020,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because in principle\nthe geometric shapes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4849660,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can be represented by an\ninfinite number of variables."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4852780,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you have a very huge\nnumber of variables."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4855260,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So shouldn't you be doing the\noptimization of all of them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4858620,
    "dDurationMs": 3258,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "together rather than saying, I'm\ngoing to do source optimization."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4861878,
    "dDurationMs": 1542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You should be saying,\nI'm going to do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4863420,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the optimization of everything\nthe source, the mask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4867500,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I do it all in one\nbig optimization."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4869500,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah so let me first\nanswer that question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4872820,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're absolutely right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4873900,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And perhaps I wasn't\ncompletely clear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4876280,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Remember that video where\nwe picked some clips out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4880200,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of this huge design."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4882060,
    "dDurationMs": 6020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those clips were supposed\nto be representative proxies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4888080,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the incredible variety of\npatterns of the whole design."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4893240,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When we optimize\nthe illumination,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4895880,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we optimize that with\nthe OPC for those clips."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4900280,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we but we cannot say,\nlet's optimize the whole design"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4906920,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with hundreds of\nbillions of patterns,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4909480,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "together with all these\nvariables in the illumination"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4912760,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and with all of the variables\nin the projection optics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4916040,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's simply computationally\nis not yet feasible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4919560,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what we do is we take\nsome of these clips."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4922080,
    "dDurationMs": 820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There we go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4922900,
    "dDurationMs": 3790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Optimize then we say,\nnow this illumination,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4926690,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "probably since it is good for\nthe most critical patterns,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4930050,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will be good for all\nof the other patterns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4932130,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then we do the OPC, a\ndivide and conquer strategy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4935450,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once the OPC stage, you don't\nchange the design anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4939330,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to have to cut us\noff our no, no I'm sorry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4943970,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our AV support is going to leave\nus and we're well after time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4949210,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the speakers\nwill stick around"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4951510,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and happy to answer\nquestions one on one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4956070,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's thank both speakers\nfor a fascinating talk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4964270,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you want\nto stick around, I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4966710,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "think they'll be glad to\nanswer for the questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4969370,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Absolutely, absolutely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4973190,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How are you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4974710,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I haven't seen\nyou for a long time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4977090,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah so I'm doing fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4979410,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I understand that you\nare retired or not yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4983250,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I am semi-retired."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4984810,
    "dDurationMs": 1250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm"
    } ]
  } ]
}
